.TH DUB-CLEAN-CACHES 1 "2026-08-16" "The D Language Foundation" "The D Language Foundation"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dub-clean-caches \- Removes cached metadata
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdub clean-caches \fR\fIOPTIONS\&.\&.\&.\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This command removes any cached metadata like the list of available packages and their latest version.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS COMMON OPTIONS
See \fBdub\fR(1)
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.TP
.BR 0
DUB succeeded
.TP
.BR 1
usage errors, unknown command line flags
.TP
.BR 2
package not found, package failed to load, miscellaneous error
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
\fIdub\&.sdl\fR, \fIdub\&.json\fR
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Copyright (c) 1999-2026 by The D Language Foundation
.SH ONLINE DOCUMENTATION
.URhttp://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
http://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
.UE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdub\fR(1), \fBdub-clean\fR(1), \fBdub-remove\fR(1)
